"| 52 Ah\n"
"| 64.4 Ah\n"
"\n"
"| Energy per module\n"
"| 2.2 kWh\n"
"| 2.8 kWh\n"
"| Cells per module (in series)\n"
"| 14\n"
"| 14\n"
