#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/systems/fenecon-home-battery.adoc
msgid ""
"A small charging current is therefore still permitted even at 100 %. The "
"code does not give a reason for this."
msgstr ""
"Auch bei 100 % ist also noch ein kleiner Ladestrom erlaubt. Einen Grund "
"dafür nennt der Code nicht."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/systems/fenecon-home-battery.adoc
msgid ""
"In addition, the **highest cell voltage** limits the current (64.4 Ah "
"modules only):"
msgstr "Zusätzlich begrenzt die **höchste Zellspannung** (nur 64,4-Ah-Module):"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/systems/fenecon-home-battery.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Charging current depending on the highest cell voltage (64.4 Ah)"
msgstr "Ladestrom abhängig von der höchsten Zellspannung (64,4 Ah)"

#. type: Table
